  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "Y[t1_] := (y /. DSolve[- D[y[t] t, t] / y'[t] == f[t], y, t])[[1]][t] /. { K[1] -> x, C[1] -> 1, t -> t1 }\nODExp = - (D[Y[t], t] / D[f[t], t])",
